  "kind": "ability",
  "variant": 3,
  "name": "Низкий боковой взмах",
  "prompt": "One single low horizontal club sweep toward screen right. The creature crouches slightly deeper, draws the club back beside its hip, then twists its compact torso into a fast wide side swing with a short attached pale arc and one clear impact accent. Its heavy head lunges forward low, the free claw supports the weight, and short bent legs make only a tiny grounded push. No standing tall, no full spin, no second attack. The swing has a readable weighted follow-through; then return to the original deep crouch, club across belly and exact starting position. Ragged cloth settles. Fixed camera, no clipping.",
